WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.354
Week 10: Likes, Preferences, and Leisure. express likes and dislikes invite and suggest compare activities

2
00:00:07.354 --> 00:00:13.577
Mission brief. Plan a free evening for three people with different preferences and constraints.

3
00:00:13.577 --> 00:00:23.259
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:23.259 --> 00:00:31.403
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:31.403 --> 00:00:40.186
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:40.186 --> 00:01:10.903
Model language. Voy a planificar una tarde libre para tres personas. — I am going to plan a free evening for three people. Considero las restricciones de cada persona. — I consider each person's constraints. Propongo dos actividades distintas. — I propose two different activities. Acordamos una opción que satisface a todos. — We agree on an option that satisfies everyone. Buscamos un compromiso justo. — We look for a fair compromise.

7
00:01:10.903 --> 00:01:20.907
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
